{
  "_about": [
    "Hand written ground truth for the sample documents. Values were read off the",
    "documents by eye, not copied from pipeline output, which is the only way this",
    "file is worth anything.",
    "",
    "A null means the document genuinely does not state the field, so extracting",
    "something for it counts as a false positive. A field left out of a document's",
    "block is not graded. 'line_item_total' is graded instead of a line item count",
    "because the count depends on whether markup and bond rows are treated as items",
    "while the total does not.",
    "",
    "co_010 is deliberately inconsistent: its stated new contract sum does not match",
    "prior sum plus this change, and its day count does not match its dates. The gold",
    "values record what the document says, not what it should have said.",
    "",
    "'expected_decision' is weaker evidence than the field values. The field values are",
    "facts about the document; the decision is a judgement about how much checking the",
    "document deserves, and it depends on where the thresholds are set. Treat a",
    "mismatch there as a prompt to look, not as a failure on its own."
  ],

